# Development Dockerfile for PostgreSQL and Adminer services
# Note: This file is a placeholder as both PostgreSQL and Adminer use pre-built images
# defined directly in the docker-compose.dev.yml file.

# This file can be left empty or used for any custom database initialization
# scripts or extensions if needed in the future.

# No build steps are required for the database services as they use
# official Docker images (postgres:16-alpine and adminer:4.8.1).